         OR  "(2)" ... any (GIVEN e YIELD `s 65 "child" (2) — the insured person named in` e `supported the child, in` `the family` `, reading a resident housewife as` `the housewife`) (`the child`'s `parents`))
    AND "ובלבד שהילד נמצא בישראל" ... `s 65 — in Israel on` (`the family`'s `the day`) `:` `the child` `, reading a missing day as` `the missing day`
    AND "ולא מלאו לו 18 שנים"     ... `s 65 — the age limb, asked` `the question` `, reading a missing day as` `the missing day` `, on` (`the family`'s `the day`) `:` `the child`
    AND `s 1 — not a married boy or girl` `the child`
